{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：从动机到满足关系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/model-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-model-theory","title":"为何模型论：语义视角下的数学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/model-theory/foundations/why-model-theory","wordCount":1423,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"structures-languages","title":"结构与语言：模型论的两个基本对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/model-theory/foundations/structures-languages","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"satisfaction-truth","title":"满足与真：Tarski 定义的核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/model-theory/foundations/satisfaction-truth","wordCount":1468,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础-从动机到满足关系\">基础：从动机到满足关系</h1><p>要谈&quot;哪个结构让哪句公式为真&quot;，得先把三样东西说清楚：我们为什么要把语义单独拎出来研究、&quot;结构&quot;和&quot;语言&quot;到底是什么样的数学对象、以及&quot;真&quot;这个直觉概念如何被压缩成一条无歧义的归纳定义。这一章正是这三步，也是整个 hub 无法跳过的地基。</p>\n<p>第一篇《为何模型论》给出全景动机：它对比句法与语义两种视角，讲清模型论区别于证明论的问题意识，并用一条历史线索（Tarski→Robinson→Morley→Shelah）说明这门学科要解决什么、发展到了哪里——但不涉及任何形式定义的细节。第二篇《结构与语言》把对象钉死：签名、项、公式的归纳生成，L-结构、子结构、嵌入与同态，是后面所有定理运转的零件。第三篇《满足与真》交出模型论最核心的一块砖——Tarski 的满足关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"fraktur\">M</mi><mo>⊨</mo><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathfrak{M} \\models \\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.999em;vertical-align:-0.249em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathfrak\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span>，由它派生出理论、模型、初等等价与可定义集这些反复出现的概念。</p>\n<p>在 hub 的四条主线里，本章是第一条，服务于其余全部。读&quot;定理&quot;章时你会不断回到这里的满足定义；读&quot;类型&quot;章时&quot;可定义集&quot;的直觉源头也在这里。建议严格按 1→2→3 顺序阅读。前置只需一阶逻辑的句法直觉和朴素集合论。</p>\n"}